app
  ctrl+c  ^c  quit  on
  ?       ?   help  on

checks
  esc       esc     checks        on
  ctrl+r    ^r      rerun failed  on
  r ctrl+r  r       refresh       on
  o         o       browser       on
  enter     ↵       open          off
  up k      ↑/k     up            off
  down j    ↓/j     down          off
  pgup b    pgup/b  page up       off
  pgdown f  pgdn/f  page down     off
  home g    g/home  first         off
  end G     G/end   last          off
  A         A       annotations   off

annotations
  A       A    annotations  off
  up k    ↑/k  up           off
  down j  ↓/j  down         off
  enter   ↵    open file    off
  o       o    browser      off

log
  up k         ↑/k     up            on
  down j       ↓/j     down          on
  pgup b       b/pgup  page up       on
  pgdown f     f/pgdn  page down     on
  u ctrl+u     u       ½ page up     on
  d ctrl+d     d       ½ page down   on
  home g       g/home  top           on
  end G        G/end   bottom        on
  space enter  space   fold          on
  +            +       expand        on
  -            -       collapse      on
  *            *       fold all      on
  e            e       next error    off
  E            E       prev error    off
  w            w       next warning  off
  W            W       prev warning  off
  /            /       search        on
  enter        enter   search        off
  esc          esc     cancel        off
  n            n       next match    off
  N            N       prev match    off
  left h       ←/h     left          on
  right l      →/l     right         on
  s            s       wrap          on
  t            t       times         on
  #            #       line numbers  on
  F            F       follow        on
  esc          esc     back          on
